loot fp_deepchest MetalIngot*2;Battery*1
prop fp_deepchest on.open=message||A barge manifest in the strongbox: IRON AND STONE FOR THE PILE FOOT - FORTY TONS - NIGHT DELIVERY. Signed for the Council, A.C. The gallery's pumps beside it are set to fill, not drain.
note fp_ledge Climber's cache | A climber's cache on a ledge off the trail - rope, a flask, a few bolts.
